---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: In use
eyebrow: Showcase
subtitle: Publications running on Project Broadsheet.
permalink: /showcase/
---
<div class="lead" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
  Reading a description of what Project Broadsheet does is one thing — seeing a real publication built with it is another. The sites below are live and public. Click around, read a few pieces, try the reading tools, and see how it feels as a reader.
</div>

<div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-block: var(--space-xl);">
  {% for s in showcase %}
  <a class="showcase-card" href="{{ s.url }}">
    <div class="showcase-card__image">{{ s.name }}</div>
    <div class="showcase-card__body">
      <div class="card__title">{{ s.name }}</div>
      <p class="card__summary">{{ s.summary }}</p>
      <div class="showcase-card__tags">
        {% for t in s.tags %}<span class="badge">{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </a>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<hr class="gold-rule">

<section class="section-sm">
  <h2 class="h3">Built something with it?</h2>
  <p class="lead">Send me a link and I'll add it here.</p>
  <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Write to me</a>
</section>
